Research question: {{$json.question}}
Audience: {{$json.audience}}
Input valid: {{$json.inputValid}}
Evidence quality: {{$json.evidenceQuality}}
Quality issues: {{$json.qualityIssues}}
Closed synthetic sources: {{$json.sources}}

